OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police has said it was made aware
OL,7,Fof the potential for protests in Dover
OL,8,Fthe day before they took place but
OL,9,Finformation "was not fully assessed".
OL,11,FA large group of protesters dressed in
OL,12,Fblack and wearing balaclavas blocked
OL,13,Faccess to the the Port of Dover on
OL,14,FSaturday for several hours, with
OL,15,Fwitnesses hearing them chanting "stop
OL,16,Fthe boats".
OL,18,FKent Police had previously said it did
OL,19,Fnot know about the demonstration in
OL,20,Fadvance, leading to accusations of a
OL,21,Ffailure in intelligence-gathering.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
