OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, the force said an initial
OL,7,Freview found it had received
OL,8,Fnon-emergency information late on
OL,9,FFriday evening which "may have allowed
OL,10,Fthe force to consider its resourcing",
OL,11,Fbut did not share what it was told.
